cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "stockout: ten scikit-learn models on one preprocessing pipeline"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tejas
    family-names: Deshmane
    email: tejasdeshmane66@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
url: "https://github.com/Surge77/stockout"
abstract: >-
  A teaching package that fits four regressors and six classifiers on two tabular
  datasets, each behind the same StandardScaler pipeline, and compares them on one
  held-out split so the estimator is the only thing that varies between rows of the
  results table. Deliberately restricted to the scikit-learn surface covered by an
  introductory course: train_test_split, Pipeline, StandardScaler, PolynomialFeatures,
  the linear models, the tree and kernel classifiers, and three metrics.
keywords:
  - scikit-learn
  - regression
  - classification
  - pipeline
  - teaching
